WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Meet Zerre. A companion for the whole day.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Wanders, hops onto windows, plays, reacts to your touch, and naps on the Dock.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Books, bubbles, doodles, games, visiting friends, and a different daily theme.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Agent done or needs you? Zerre notices. Click it to return to your terminal.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Reacts to git commits and long commands, including failed commands.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Write notes naturally. Pin to-dos, set reminders, and choose your morning three.

7
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Set focus blocks and breaks. The blur spreads out from your window, menu bar too, lighter around your work. Blur and darkness are yours to set.

8
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Routine deliveries wait in its backpack. Reminders and waiting agents still get through.

9
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Keep its home by the notch, or turn it off: notes go on a little board that pops up beside Zerre, and it pins each one.

10
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Tea for a short break. A nap for a long one. Set the lengths that suit you.

11
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Finished blocks grow ripe tomatoes. Stop early for green ones. Keep daily jars, weekly bottles, and a block recap.

12
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Habits shape 22 traits, moods and pastimes. First-time celebrations and lasting achievements.

13
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Put on any achievement you have earned, or take it off. Free spots fill with the habits of your week.

14
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Morning pick-3, welcome back, meetings, hour marks, water, stretching and a day wrap-up.

15
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Quiet during meetings, focus and the night. Reacts to heat and low battery. Hides while screen sharing.

16
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Settings in small pages. Local data, optional connections, login, updates, silent notifications, export and erase. On-device intelligence when available.

17
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Live menu bar and terminal dashboard. Check events and control focus with zerrectl.

18
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Meet your new Mac companion. Free for Apple silicon Macs on macOS 26 or later. zerre.dogukaan.dev
